Package: psyWiz
Type: Package
Title: Psychometric Wizardry: Multi-Estimator CFA and Measurement Invariance
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Herman", "Elgueta", email = "herman.elgueta@umag.cl", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6764-5490"))
Description: Tools for confirmatory factor analysis built on 'lavaan', usable
    from R and as a 'jamovi' module. Tests measurement invariance across groups
    step by step, for continuous items and for ordinal items (Wu & Estabrook,
    2016), with a verdict for each step and score tests that point at the
    constraints that fit worst. Fits one model under several estimators and
    shows fit, loadings and reliability side by side. Independent models are
    fitted on several processor cores when that saves time.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/heelgueta/psywiz
BugReports: https://github.com/heelgueta/psywiz/issues
